/教学/出题/错题</text><rect x='257.0' y='214' width='186' height='48' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='350.0' y='244' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>试卷与生涯维度</text><rect x='481.0' y='214' width='186' height='48' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='574.0' y='244' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>底层体系版本与质量分析</text><rect x='257.0' y='268' width='186' height='48' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='350.0' y='298' font-size='15' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>MCP 能力服务（对外）</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>系统定位</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>一套系统覆盖学生、教师、学校三类使用者，共用课程、知识点、步骤与套路定义。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>单题引擎是能力底座，向上支撑刷题、作业、考试与生涯档案。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>教学协同 Agent 是统一对话入口，按已认证身份切换角色视角。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>通过 MCP 对外提供教育能力服务，宿主负责对话与通用办公能力。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：全部 12 份设计文档综述</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 3 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>